ons failed to produce a new contract before Sunday's deadline. \"Significant issues remain unresolved,\" Portneuf said in a press release. Regence told Local News 8, \"As an Idaho not-for-profit insurer, we remain committed to ensuring any new agreement respects the healthcare affordability needs of our members.\""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},